(text "3.3V power, local bypassing, boot straps and 40 MHz crystal.\nR106 0-ohm bridge feeds VDDA pins55/56 and C105 while preserving crystal ground.\nGPIO46 pulled LOW; GPIO45 NC (FH4R2 fixed 3.3V VDD_SPI). Boot recovery: hold SW1 and pulse EN low." (at 20 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "a69a3e6c-33c0-593c-9fc6-8cdc6c85b36a"))
